- "5 healthiest/safest manicures that won't damage your nails"

**Intent content signals:** Wants a direct verdict up top (not buried), responds to mechanism-based explanations ("it's the acetone, not the gel"), wants condition-specific guidance (weak nails vs healthy nails), skeptical of salon-branded content, receptive to medical/dermatologist citations as trust signal, prefers scannable structure over dense paragraphs.

